mponent removal, pair-distance masking, storage-order reinterpretations). None matched. Notably the vendor tensor is stationary to \u00b11% across frames while this recording's band power swings up to 7\u00d7 frame-to-frame \u2014 evidence the export's content isn't fully consistent with this sound file (e.g., a background-reference export or device-internal calibration unavailable in the capture). I therefore shipped the physically-correct, contract-exact implementation.",
